      <div class="srow"><div class="st">2:00 PM</div><div><h3>Video Review <span style="color:var(--muted);text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-weight:400">(select days)</span></h3><p>Watch footage, receive coaching, plan improvements.</p></div></div>
