        <ul>
          <li>Transportation from Panama City (round-trip)</li>
          <li>7 nights accommodation</li>
          <li>12 meals (6 breakfasts, 6 dinners)</li>
          <li>12 jet ski tow-in sessions</li>
          <li>Drone filming</li>
          <li>Video analysis coaching</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="mailto:shokogipanama@gmail.com?subject=Foil%20Retreat%20Panama%20Booking" class="bbtn">Email Us to Book</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></div>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <div class="sec tint"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker" style="text-align:center">Learn more about the Foil Retreat</div>
    <h2>FAQ</h2>
    <div class="faq" style="margin-top:22px">
      <details open><summary>What skill level do I need?</summary><div class="ans">You must already be comfortable flying a hydrofoil behind a jet ski, boat, or wing. This retreat is for intermediate to advanced foilers transitioning to wave riding.</div></details>
      <details><summary>How does the video approval process work?</summary><div class="ans">Before booking, submit foil riding videos showing your current ability to <a href="mailto:shokogipanama@gmail.com">shokogipanama@gmail.com</a>. This ensures all participants have similar skill levels for the best group experience.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Should I bring my own foil equipment or rent?</summary><div class="ans">Foil equipment (board, foil, helmet, impact vest) isn&rsquo;t included &mdash; bring your own or rent. A complete foil setup is available for $100 per day and includes a foil board; reserve your gear when booking.</div></details>
      <details><summary>How many hours on the water each day?</summary><div class="ans">Up to two tow-in sessions per day, each 1.5&ndash;2 hours on the water &mdash; up to 12 sessions across the retreat.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Are flights to Panama included?</summary><div class="ans">No &mdash; flights to Panama City are not included. Round-trip transportation from Panama City to Playa Venao is included.</div></details>
      <details><summary>How big are the waves at Playa Venao?</summary><div class="ans">Playa Venao receives consistent Pacific swells year-round and is never flat. For this retreat you should be comfortable in intermediate waves &mdash; chest-high and above.</div></details>
      <details><summary>Is this suitable for beginners?</summary><div class="ans">No &mdash; this retreat requires existing tow-in experience. If you&rsquo;re new to foiling, start with our beginner foil lessons to build foundational skills first.</div></details>
    </div>
  </div></div>

  <!-- CLOSER -->
  <div class="sec"><div class="wrap closer">
    <h2>Ready to ride empty, perfect waves?</h2>
    <p>Just 4 spots per retreat. Email us your foil videos to apply and book your place in Playa Venao.</p>
    <a href="mailto:shokogipanama@gmail.com?subject=Foil%20Retreat%20Panama%20Booking" class="btn pink">Email Us to Book</a>
  </div></div>
</div>

<script>
/* Each clip loads the first time it scrolls into view (preload="none") and then
   just plays while visible / pauses when off-screen - the decoded buffer is kept,
   NOT thrown away. Fully detaching + reloading them on every pass made scrolling
   back UP re-decode all four at once -> a memory burst that reloaded the tab.
   With the assembly now lightweight (zoom), keeping the buffers is affordable. */
(function(){
  var vids=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.skp video.skvid'));
  if(!vids.length) return;
  var play=function(v){ try{ var p=v.play(); if(p&&p.catch) p.catch(function(){}); }catch(e){} };
  if(!('IntersectionObserver' in window)){ vids.forEach(play); return; }
  var io=new IntersectionObserver(function(ents){
    ents.forEach(function(e){
      var v=e.target;
      if(e.isIntersecting){ play(v); }
      else if(!v.paused){ v.pause(); }
    });
  }, {rootMargin:'300px 0px', threshold:0.1});
  vids.forEach(function(v){ io.observe(v); });
})();
</script>

